WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.406 --> 00:00:03.690
Unit twenty. Occupational Health!

2
00:00:04.638 --> 00:00:09.346
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.396 --> 00:00:12.365
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.415 --> 00:00:16.449
Today we learn about Occupational Health. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.363 --> 00:00:22.097
Occupational health. Say it with me. Occupational health!

6
00:00:25.585 --> 00:00:29.085
Hazard. Say it with me. Hazard!

7
00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:36.898
Ergonomics. Say it with me. Ergonomics!

8
00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:45.107
Protective equipment. Say it with me. Protective equipment!

9
00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:52.810
Chemicals. Say it with me. Chemicals!

10
00:00:56.332 --> 00:01:00.032
Noise. Say it with me. Noise!

11
00:01:03.569 --> 00:01:07.236
Rights. Say it with me. Rights!

12
00:01:10.716 --> 00:01:14.383
Training. Say it with me. Training!

13
00:01:17.907 --> 00:01:28.532
Occupational health protects workers from each hazard, such as chemicals and noise. Ergonomics, protective equipment, training, and workers' rights reduce injuries.

14
00:01:28.582 --> 00:01:31.821
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:32.753 --> 00:01:37.944
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:37.994 --> 00:01:39.194
Ergonomics!

17
00:01:40.425 --> 00:01:45.665
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.715 --> 00:01:46.865
Rights!

19
00:01:47.856 --> 00:01:54.559
Did you know? Good ergonomics — how a workspace is set up — can prevent back and wrist pain!

20
00:01:54.609 --> 00:01:57.009
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:58.058 --> 00:02:06.679
Think and answer. What hazards exist in a job you are interested in?

22
00:02:06.729 --> 00:02:07.879
Great answer!

23
00:02:08.787 --> 00:02:14.548
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:14.598 --> 00:02:17.316
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

